{"team":"CLE","col":"#FF7A45","identity":"balanced","funnel":"run-funnel","plays_pg":63.2,"adot":7.3,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>No Fixed Address</h2><p>There's no bell-cow to bank on \u2014 the lead back sees just <strong>48%</strong> of carries (league ~59%), a committee that caps any one back's ceiling and makes their rushing props matchup- and script-dependent.</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 62% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>By the numbers it's a struggling unit \u2014 a 36% success rate (below the 44% average).</p><p><strong>Harold Fannin Jr.</strong> is a genuine centerpiece, not an afterthought \u2014 <strong>18%</strong> of targets (league ~15%).</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Inside the 20 they stay aggressive, throwing <strong>56%</strong> of the time, which puts scoring equity on <strong>Jerry Jeudy</strong>. And with the TE commanding 18% of targets, <strong>Harold Fannin Jr.</strong> is a live red-zone option too.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 The Run Comes Free</h2><p>They surrender <strong>124 rushing</strong> and <strong>209 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). The run moves against them \u2014 <strong>target opposing RB1s</strong>.</p><p>They lock down opposing tight ends \u2014 just 24 rec yds/game (vs ~35); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They lock down backs out of the backfield \u2014 just 12 rec yds/game (vs ~18); fade receiving props there.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.59/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>A stingy, efficient defense \u2014 just 41% success allowed (vs ~44%); temper expectations for opposing skill players.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing RB1s</strong> smash on the ground and at the goal line.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Deshaun Watson","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Comp":19.13,"Att":31.0,"Pass Yds":191.16,"Pass TD":1.18,"INT":1.55,"Rush Yds":13.8}}],"RB":[{"name":"Quinshon Judkins","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":34,"props":{"Rush Att":13.0,"Rush Yds":47.81,"Tgt":4.16,"Rec":3.17,"Rec Yds":21.21}},{"name":"Dylan Sampson","slot":"RB2","starter":true,"td":20,"props":{"Rush Att":7.85,"Rush Yds":24.73,"Tgt":3.81,"Rec":3.11,"Rec Yds":24.12}},{"name":"Raheim Sanders","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":22,"props":{"Rush Att":4.08,"Rush Yds":15.4,"Tgt":2.42,"Rec":1.63,"Rec Yds":11.31}}],"WR":[{"name":"Jerry Jeudy","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":15,"props":{"Tgt":6.93,"Rec":4.29,"Rec Yds":58.29,"Rec TD":0.16}},{"name":"KC Concepcion","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":20,"props":{"Tgt":6.25,"Rec":3.98,"Rec Yds":49.71,"Rec TD":0.21}},{"name":"Denzel Boston","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":14,"props":{"Tgt":4.0,"Rec":2.54,"Rec Yds":32.59,"Rec TD":0.15}},{"name":"Isaiah Bond","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":5,"props":{"Tgt":2.99,"Rec":1.31,"Rec Yds":18.79,"Rec TD":0.05}},{"name":"Tylan Wallace","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":10,"props":{"Tgt":2.73,"Rec":1.5,"Rec Yds":20.84,"Rec TD":0.1}}],"TE":[{"name":"Harold Fannin Jr.","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":29,"props":{"Tgt":7.76,"Rec":5.43,"Rec Yds":55.1,"Rec TD":0.34}},{"name":"Blake Whiteheart","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":11,"props":{"Tgt":2.62,"Rec":1.52,"Rec Yds":13.93,"Rec TD":0.12}},{"name":"Carsen Ryan","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":2.08,"Rec":1.27,"Rec Yds":12.58,"Rec TD":0.08}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"@","opp":"JAX","opp_col":"#19D3C5","gid":"2026_01_CLE_JAX","spread":"+7.5","proj":"16\u201324","win":false},{"week":2,"ha":"@","opp":"TB","opp_col":"#FF5A4D","gid":"2026_02_CLE_TB","spread":"+6.5","proj":"18\u201324","win":false},{"week":3,